WEBVTT - PaddlePost demo captions v11

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.559
This is PaddlePost. One app for pickleball. Find courts, join games, and track your matches, all in one place.

2
00:00:05.559 --> 00:00:11.199
Need a game? Open Play and find courts near you. Search any city, see the courts, and check in when you arrive.

3
00:00:11.199 --> 00:00:14.761
Tap a court to see the details. Photos, reviews, and who is checked in.

4
00:00:14.761 --> 00:00:19.691
Here is a game for Saturday morning. Joanna is the host. One player is in, and eleven spots are still open.

5
00:00:19.691 --> 00:00:24.569
Open play runs on court assignments. Joanna is on Court 1. Courts 2 and 3 are still empty.

6
00:00:24.569 --> 00:00:28.083
After you play, log the match. Joanna won 11 to 5 in doubles.

7
00:00:28.083 --> 00:00:34.657
Then 11 to 9 in doubles. Two wins, no losses. Her badges are First Serve, First W, and Storyteller.

8
00:00:34.657 --> 00:00:37.959
Her rating is now 3.45. Her streak is two wins.

9
00:00:37.959 --> 00:00:40.559
Everything lands in the feed.

10
00:00:40.559 --> 00:00:43.159
Every match lands in the feed, with the score and the court.

11
00:00:43.159 --> 00:00:45.759
Trending shows the most liked posts of the week.

12
00:00:45.759 --> 00:00:48.907
That is the feed, the stats, and the profile, all from one account.

13
00:00:48.907 --> 00:00:53.200
PaddlePost is free while we are in beta. Come find your game.
